      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Plate tectonics refined Wegener’s ideas by explaining that both continents and ocean floors move together as parts of lithospheric plates. These plates float over the asthenosphere, a mechanically weak and partially molten zone. ",
      "id": "o57hfki"
